<view class="flow-card"><text class="h3">草稿还在</text><view class="flow-notice">事项刚刚更新了。你的输入已保留，请查看最新内容。</view><button class="outline-button" bindtap="loadLatest">查看最新内容</button><view wx:if="{{latest}}"><text class="paragraph">最新标题：{{latest.title}}</text><text class="paragraph">最新备注：{{latest.note || '无'}}</text><text class="paragraph">最新安排：{{latest.schedule.kind === 'once' ? (latest.schedule.date || '未安排') : latest.schedule.startDate}} · {{latest.schedule.kind === 'once' ? (latest.schedule.time || '不限定时刻') : (latest.schedule.kind === 'daily' ? '每天' : '每周')}}</text><button class="outline-button" bindtap="keepDraft">保留我的输入并重新核对</button></view></view>
